        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/53a042/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-26T20:41:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This might be something that's been previously answered, but...</p><p>How long ago was the world built?&nbsp; I get the impression that it existed well before the SotM game was bring written.</p><p>What was the initial motivation for creating the SotM world?&nbsp; Was there originally plans to create a comic universe to tell/publish stories in?&nbsp; Was it for a superhero RPG?&nbsp; Or was it world building for the sake of world building?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:40:35.661Z",
