        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/{size}/1997_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-26T21:10:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For fun. Its Adam and Christophers private comic book world. Just made for fun, and SotM was made to play in that world, for fun. Then Paul showed up with a business plan and said \"You could do this for a living!\" and they are.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>At least, thats the impression ive gotten from listening to Christopher talk about it.</p>",
