        "raw": "<p>For fun. Its Adam and Christophers private comic book world. Just made for fun, and SotM was made to play in that world, for fun. Then Paul showed up with a business plan and said &quot;You could do this for a living!&quot; and they are.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>At least, thats the impression ive gotten from listening to Christopher talk about it.</p>",
