      {
        "id": 93907,
        "name": "UXM266",
        "username": "UXM266",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/uxm266/{size}/1966_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-26T21:52:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What I love about their world is that they show so much love to the every kind of comic book style, every character is either a loving homage to a popular character or a complete. The tongue-in-cheek humor, the shout-outs, and charm of the characters make the game so intriguing.&nbsp;</p><p>To me the universe is more of a love letter to 75ish years of work done by 1000s of creators. I especially love that how much time was planned out since the original release those years ago! I love how gigantic this thing getting, it's as though they are bringing the power the wrath of the cosmos upon us! I am always caught of guard how much is planned, from card art being in used in the original edition only being shown in Vengeance! I am alays surprised, and just love everything they plan out.&nbsp;</p><p>TL;DR: Essentially, Greater Than Games, you guys are totally kickass!</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:20:16.484Z",
